## Launch risks

:::risk{#data-loss impact=critical likelihood=high owner=@ops status=open} Data loss during the migration
Mitigation: snapshot each batch before it runs; restore drill on Friday.
:::

:::risk{impact=low likelihood=critical owner="@maya @li" status=accepted} Flaky end-to-end tests | retries
Retries are cheap. We accept the noise until Q4.
:::

:::risk Nobody has scored this yet
- Impact and likelihood are missing, so both count as medium.
:::

::::risk{impact=high likelihood=medium owner=@payments status=mitigated} Payment provider rate limits
:::warning Pre-warm
Ask the provider for a temporary quota increase.
:::
::::

:::risk{impact=high likelihood=high status=closed} Vendor lock-in
Closed after the contract change.
:::

